notes:
{末|すえ} is the end of something in space, time, or a process. The ～⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{末|すえ} / ～た{末|すえ} pattern implies that the result came only after a long or difficult process.

COMMON PATTERNS:
- ～⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{末|すえ}（に）: after (a long process), at the end of: ⟦{苦労|くろう}→苦労：02672_kurou⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{末|すえ}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧, ⟦{議論|ぎろん}→議論：02650_giron⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{末|すえ}
- ～た{末|すえ}（に）: after doing ~ at length: ⟦{悩|なや}んだ→悩む：02380_nayamu⟧{末|すえ}, ⟦{考|かんが}えた→考える：00856_kangaeru⟧{末|すえ}
- ⟦{来月|らいげつ}→来月：00744_raigetsu⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{末|すえ}, ⟦{年|とし}→年：00486_toshi⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{末|すえ}: the end of a period

PRONUNCIATION:
- {末|すえ}: kun'yomi, used independently or in patterns like ～⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{末|すえ}
- ⟦{末|まつ}→〜末：31573_matsu⟧: on'yomi, used in compounds like ⟦{週末|しゅうまつ}→週末：03030_shuumatsu⟧, ⟦{月末|げつまつ}→月末：00070_getsumatsu⟧, ⟦{年末|ねんまつ}→年末：17688_nenmatsu⟧, ⟦{今月末|こんげつまつ}→今月末：28384_kongetsumatsu⟧; write these with まつ, not すえ
